   "description": "<p class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\">I 'transmigrated' into a world I've never seen.</p><p class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\">I spent 30 years, thinking it was a traditional RPG.</p><p class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\">Having retired after becoming a war hero, I was now waiting to meet the ending.</p><p class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\">But somehow-</p><p class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\">The 30 years I've spent till now was just a prologue, and this world was actually an academy genre?</p>",
